-- =========================================================================
-- ActionResult — the action-handler return-shape ADT (Phase 13a-1).
--
-- Lifted from the TS interface in core/src/actions/registry.ts (Shape B per
-- the 13a-1 brief: provenance preservation + tie-in to state:appendEvent's
-- new aggregate* params). The 6 12d C-wrappers (forms + inventory +
-- purchases + payments + profiles + imports) consume the ADT via a TS-side
-- actionResultAdtToTs(adt) adapter that translates to the existing
-- ActionResult interface (backward-compat for downstream TS consumers).
--
-- The ActionOk arm carries provenance via three Maybe<String> fields
-- (aggregateType / aggregateId / profileId); ActionErr carries just a
-- message. The asymmetry is intentional: errors don't have an aggregate.
-- =========================================================================

ActionResult = ActionOk data: Record aggregateType: Maybe<String> aggregateId: Maybe<String> profileId: Maybe<String>
  | ActionErr message: String
